Native Python desktop assistance using explicit user-supplied context. No personal profile,
preloaded memories, credentials, screenshots or history database are bundled. Some implementation
changes were produced with AI assistance. No benchmarks or adoption claims are implied.

Third-party components include Python, PyQt5/Qt, HTTPX, Pillow, MSS, keyring and python-dotenv.
They and their transitive dependencies retain their respective licenses. Review installed package
metadata and Qt distribution requirements before sharing a bundled executable. No downloaded
artwork is included; the flower mark uses original code-native vector geometry.
